{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"43882556":{"pageid":43882556,"ns":6,"title":"File:LG V10.jpg","index":3,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":205724,"width":2000,"height":1071,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/LG_V10.jpg/960px-LG_V10.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":343,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/LG_V10.jpg/1280px-LG_V10.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/LG_V10.jpg/960px-LG_V10.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":343,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/LG_V10.jpg/1280px-LG_V10.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/LG_V10.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:LG_V10.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=43882556","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"LG Electronics unveils \u2018LG V10\u2019 globally  \n<p>\u201cSmartphone with a different dimension\u201d  \n</p><p>\u25a0 One-day premium brand \u2018V10\u2019 newly introduced  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Public events held in Seoul and New York  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Sequential supply to the global market, starting with the Korean release on the 8th  \n</p><p>\u25a0 Application of heteromorphic display technology, realization of \u2018second screen\u2019  \n</p><p>\u25a1 It looks like a small rectangular display is placed on the upper right of the main screen.  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Although it is a single display, the main screen and \u2018second screen\u2019 operate independently  \n</p><p>\u25a1 SNS/text notification information, italicized signature, weather, etc. are displayed 24 hours a day  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Convenient multitasking, such as shortcuts to apps and music playback  \n</p><p>\u25a0 World's first dual front-facing camera, selfie camera that doesn't require a selfie stick  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Equipped with two 5-megapixel front-facing cameras, such as a wide-angle 120-degree angle and a normal-angle 80-degree angle  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Group selfies of 7 to 8 people can be taken with the 120 degree wide-angle camera  \n</p><p>\u25a0 Provides the best video recording experience  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Video expert mode: Manual adjustment of shutter speed/white balance/sensitivity, etc.  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Equipped with a separate anti-shake chip, stable shooting without shaking  \n</p><p>\u25a1 3 high-sensitivity microphones for more vivid recording  \n</p><p>\u25a0 Durability made with differentiated materials  \n</p><p>\u25a1 \u2018Dura Guard\u2019 with stainless steel 316L used in luxury watches  \n</p><p>\u25a1 \u2018Dura Skin\u2019 made of silicone material that is strong against shock and scratches  \n</p><p>\u25a0 Provides premium sound with rich acoustics  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Built-in 32-bit hi-fi DAC (Digital to Analog Converter)  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Supports \u2018up-sampling\u2019 that reproduces general sound sources close to the original sound  \n</p><p>\u25a1 Optimum output for full performance even with high-performance headphones  \n</p>\n\u203b You can check the related press release at Social LG Electronics (social.lge.co.kr/newsroom).","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"LG Electronics","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"115733198":{"pageid":115733198,"ns":6,"title":"File:Lily Cao recording using selfie stick and iPhone 20220228.jpg","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":467912,"width":1152,"